 artistic execution, demonstrating that critical acclaim remains a vital component of a film's overall commercial and cultural success in the modern entertainment industry.</p>	Thelma (2024) earns strong critical acclaim on Rotten Tomatoes, underscoring the film's impact and the platform's enduring influence on audience perception and film industry success.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1764581659081-af662e1db71c?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxmaWxtJTIwaW5kdXN0cnklMkMlMjBtb3ZpZSUyMHJldmlld3MlMkMlMjBjcml0aWNhbCUyMHJlY2VwdGlvbnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzczNTU5NzY3fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	Rotten Tomatoes	https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE4wNU5sOGVMeEQxbl9QbGVySXZ1bHg5d015WFVlZ2hTd1luak5fTHhZMDFGNDJVQWxDdi1uT1ZRU2ZtajN6MWdXWGtxVjV1N3FlbU1Bc2w5SQ?oc=5	\N	2026-03-15 07:29:27.143	2026-03-15 07:29:27.183924	Business	57
