der of the season.</p>	Kawhi Leonard delivered a historic performance, leading the LA Clippers to a dominant 153-128 victory over the struggling Minnesota Timberwolves.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1546519638-68e109498ffc?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxOQkElMjBiYXNrZXRiYWxsfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3NzMzMzIwODR8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	ClutchPoints	https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQUzBOWUxjRjJQYnpnc3Zud2V2YmptOUZZTTFHbmhqN0JBT3V2OVpydDY2VkEzY0w5R2dyTXZIVnpWMXpRZ0drSXR6V2VvNXg3a1c4Ml84NGpmU1JId20tc0dPUjh1cHhndlFzZThhM3E4WXFPS1p0MDgzdzdXVTNfVV8xYWJxY2NrQ3Z2bjVWa2J3cUtKU3plOFQ2c3lLQ2NKR1FRZXV2UQ?oc=5	\N	2026-03-12 16:14:44.965	2026-03-12 16:14:45.00649	Business	28
