sical and emotional demands of his role in Netflix's upcoming series "War Machine," providing a candid look into his intense preparation.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1643208589889-0735ad7218f0?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxhbGFuLXJpdGNoc29uJTJDJTIwd2FyLWRyYW1hJTJDJTIwbmV0ZmxpeHxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzczNDczMDQzfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	ABC4 Utah	https://news.google.?oc=5	\N	2026-03-14 07:24:03.492	2026-03-14 07:24:03.530523	Entertainment	32
