engaging and intense narrative.</p>\n\n<p>Fans anticipating 'War Machine' can expect more than just explosions and combat; they are in for a ride designed to keep them on the edge of their seats, experiencing the action not just as observers, but as participants in a chilling, high-stakes scenario. The fusion of action and horror promises a memorable and impactful cinematic journey.</p>	Actor Alan Ritchson and director Patrick Hughes detail how they injected horror movie techniques into their new action flick 'War Machine,' promising a uniquely tense viewing experience.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1662749409818-9ee02c0972da?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxhY3Rpb24tbW92aWUlMkMlMjBmaWxtLXByb2R1Y3Rpb24lMkMlMjBob3Jyb3ItZmlsbXxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzczNDczODI2fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	Space	https://news.google.?oc=5	\N	2026-03-14 07:37:06.457	2026-03-14 07:37:06.525033	Entertainment	35
