 to evolve, the aviation sector remains vigilant, monitoring developments to ensure the safety and security of passengers and crew. The gradual resumption of flights from Dubai International Airport is a crucial step towards normalizing travel and trade in a volatile region. #DubaiAirport #FlightResumption #MiddleEast #Geopolitics</p>	Dubai International Airport has gradually resumed flight operations, with Emirates expected to restart limited services, following recent geopolitical unrest impacting air travel in the Middle East.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1767470286462-0320fc4932ce?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxEdWJhaSUyMGFpcnBvcnQlMkMlMjBhaXIlMjB0cmF2ZWwlMkMlMjBnZW9wb2xpdGljc3xlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzczNjg0ODYwfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	MSN	https://news.google.?oc=5	\N	2026-03-16 18:14:20.836	2026-03-16 18:14:20.874383	World	7
