fety #WesternUSA</p>	An updated winter storm warning predicts up to 4 feet of snow and hurricane-force 80 mph winds for western highways, creating hazardous travel conditions.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1595146324047-7d1871eb770e?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHx3aW50ZXItc3Rvcm0lMkMlMjBoaWdod2F5LXRyYXZlbCUyQyUyMGV4dHJlbWUtd2VhdGhlcnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzczNTg3MDEzfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	AOL.com	https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE9zVENLNnY4ZGZkUGhvVDBKT0pELV9FVmNlNFg5eXBYd0RkZWplbk9CNVZpcEZOY1hKSmRxU09LblJtUFlTWjQ0N2pnUnVQUHhERWc2WWREWTFuU0FQRGEwUmEzOWwzUWJXWG1ZVGpZNGpsRFhMU25jdDQxMVIzVG8?oc=1	\N	2026-03-15 15:03:34.048	2026-03-15 15:03:34.088761	Weather	27
