ificantly stunt the growth of baby birds. Mild warmth, however, may sometimes promote healthier development.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1645071735495-579de12e84d8?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxiYWJ5LWJpcmRzJTJDJTIwY2xpbWF0ZS1jaGFuZ2UlMkMlMjB3aWxkbGlmZS1pbXBhY3R8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc3MzU4Njk0NHww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	Inshorts	https://news.google.?oc=5	\N	2026-03-15 15:02:24.632	2026-03-15 15:02:24.666829	Weather	30
