 of AI experts building practical applications for their own daily lives, bridging the gap between cutting-edge research and tangible benefits.</p><p>As AI continues to evolve, the concept of dedicated, custom-built AI agents like 'Dobby the Elf Claw' for home automation and personal assistance is likely to become more prevalent, transforming how individuals interact with their living spaces and manage their time.</p>	AI pioneer Andrej Karpathy unveils 'Dobby the Elf Claw,' his custom AI agent managing home tasks like pool control and package tracking, highlighting practical, everyday AI integration.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1646583288948-24548aedffd8?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxBSS1hZ2VudCUyQyUyMHNtYXJ0LWhvbWUlMkMlMjBhdXRvbWF0aW9ufGVufDB8MHx8fDE3NzQxODcwNzR8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	Business Insider	https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOS3BySFJsWWVrSnVTTlRSejZTX0JpNjMtTkVkX0RSaS1CcTdwbEJXbW5oNl9WRkxUbGlZOEdEVGEwT0hJZ0pnNTFMM3FibmZYRkNsMGpqTzBPNHd2bmdmUjVFcnpZN2tDbG5QSTFYZGxGN2m3XCIySGtnLUZGUldVRUJoaHRtZ2w0NnRwTGh6eWx6cEpO?oc=5	\N	2026-03-22 13:44:34.236	2026-03-22 13:44:34.317318	AI	12
