at if confirmed, this incident could prompt a robust international response and further complicate diplomatic efforts to de-escalate tensions.</p>	Dubai witnessed black smoke over its international airport after reports of an Iranian drone strike hitting a nearby fuel tank. This incident heightens regional tensions and sparks global concern. #DubaiAirport #IranDroneStrike #MiddleEastTensions	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1770982400459-92cd46bb60bc?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxkdWJhaSUyMGFpcnBvcnQlMkMlMjBzbW9rZSUyQyUyMGRyb25lfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3NzM2ODQ3MjF8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	The Lufkin Daily News	https://news.google.?oc=1	\N	2026-03-16 18:12:01.339	2026-03-16 18:12:01.37735	World	7
