nce on a looming deadline further amplified uncertainty, impacting market stability worldwide.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579846703547-7190c9b1b460?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxzdG9jay1tYXJrZXQlMkMlMjBnZW9wb2xpdGljYWwtcmlzayUyQyUyMG9pbC1wcmljZXN8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc3NDYzODYwOXww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	DW.com	https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNZ1RObFlmRlVHdTB5aWNEYU51bmFFQXIxLXFtYURBWXZ2WXlrU1lVbXZGZE8xQm9PZHhqSUhtU2pUbTV2LTN4YVNkN21FZjQyYVY2NTRqc3VSS3Bvdnh0eVBrMVM2TmZlcTdtNDNZTURZa3RpRlA4eU01MEJ4SnYzYkw0dG02Unk3clRnN0FIdzNJR18xYXhqYg?oc=5	\N	2026-03-27 19:10:09.924	2026-03-27 19:10:10.007673	Finance	18
