47	Nintendo Unleashes Mario Day Extravaganza with New Games, LEGO Sets, and Record-Breaking Fan Celebrations	Nintendo Unleashes Mario Day Extravaganza with New Games, LEGO Sets, and Record-Breaking Fan Celebrations	nintendo-unleashes-mario-day-extravaganza-with-new-games-lego-sets-and-record-breaking-fan-celebrations	<p>Nintendo enthusiasts worldwide converged on March 10th, affectionately known as Mario Day (Mar10), to celebrate the iconic plumber with a flurry of new game announcements, product reveals, and a spectacular record-breaking fan event across the globe.</p><h3>A Wave of New Content for Nintendo Fans</h3><p>The celebrations kicked off with a highly anticipated announcement from Nintendo: a <strong>brand-new Yoshi game</strong> is officially in development for the Nintendo Switch. While details remain scarce, the reveal has already sent waves of excitement through the gaming community, eager to embark on new adventures with Mario’s trusty dinosaur companion.</p><p>Adding to the excitement, Nintendo also pulled back the curtain on several new additions to the ever-popular LEGO Super Mario line. Fans can look forward to new minifigures and expansion sets, promising fresh ways to build and interact with the Mushroom Kingdom in brick form. These reveals underscore the enduring partnership between Nintendo and LEGO, continually offering innovative ways for fans to engage with the beloved franchise.</p><h3>Nintendo Switch Online and Exclusive Deals</h3><p>Subscribers to the Nintendo Switch Online + Expansion Pack received a welcome update, enhancing their retro gaming library and offering new features. Furthermore, Mario Day brought a treasure trove of <strong>Switch game deals</strong>, with retailers and the Nintendo eShop offering significant discounts on popular Super Mario titles. This provided a perfect opportunity for both new players and long-time fans to expand their digital collections or finally dive into games they've been eyeing.</p><h3>Mario Mania Takes Over New York City</h3><p>Perhaps one of the most visible celebrations occurred in New York City's Union Square, where a massive gathering of fans attempted to break a Guinness World Record. Hundreds of participants donned their best Super Mario costumes, creating a vibrant sea of red and blue as they swarmed the iconic location. Organized to celebrate Nintendo's beloved star, the event aimed to set a new benchmark for the most people dressed as Super Mario in one place, capturing the spirit of community and the global appeal of the franchise.</p><p>Mario Day 2026 proved to be a monumental occasion, reinforcing Super Mario's status as a cultural phenomenon and promising an exciting future for Nintendo fans with upcoming games and engaging new merchandise.</p>	Nintendo's Mario Day (Mar10) featured exciting announcements: a new Yoshi game, LEGO Super Mario sets, Switch deals, and a record-breaking fan event in NYC.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612404819070-77c6da472e68?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxuaW50ZW5kbyUyQyUyMHN1cGVyLW1hcmlvJTJDJTIwZ2FtaW5nfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3NzMzMjQ5MDl8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	9to5Toys	https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxNaEFEcnlxZUxqMGhGTmtSRFJhUnE3WlE5NDdnVEhDV2Q1dVduN2lRem5rNDJSY0FzLXA4TmE5R3Raa3NQSUdUbTdZMEd4SkR5X0RvS25TOXdlbWFPa3FqajNPS0hjZFVuTDY4bHp2ZHhCYWFGOFZ3eWlqLWQ5MWtobFBIcnFjR1YzTUE?oc=5	\N	2026-03-12 14:15:09.919	2026-03-12 14:15:09.955652	Technology	39
42	Samsung Reportedly Pulls 'Hey Plex' AI Assistant from Galaxy S26 After First Update	Samsung Reportedly Pulls 'Hey Plex' AI Assistant from Galaxy S26 After First Update	samsung-reportedly-pulls-hey-plex-ai-assistant-from-galaxy-s26-after-first-update	<p>Initially touted as a groundbreaking addition to its suite of AI capabilities, Samsung's integration of Perplexity AI, accessible via the 'Hey Plex' wake word, appears to have been swiftly removed from its new Galaxy S26 smartphones. This abrupt change, occurring with the device's very first software update, has caught many users and tech enthusiasts off guard.</p><h3>The Rise and Fall of 'Hey Plex'</h3><p>Prior to its sudden disappearance, 'Hey Plex' was positioned as the third major AI assistant on the Galaxy S26, alongside Samsung's own Bixby and Google Assistant. Leveraging Perplexity AI, a prominent generative AI search engine known for its concise and sourced answers, the feature promised a more advanced and efficient way for users to interact with their devices and retrieve information. Reports indicated that a simple 'Hey Perplexity' (or 'Hey Plex') voice command would activate this powerful tool, offering a unique blend of conversational AI and accurate search results.</p><h3>Sudden Disappearance Sparks Confusion</h3><p>However, users who received the first major software update for their Galaxy S26 units quickly noticed that the 'Hey Plex' wake word and its associated functionality were no longer present. Tech outlets like SamMobile and Android Central confirmed the removal, with some lamenting the loss of what was considered one of the most innovative AI features on the new handset. The unexpected retraction has led to widespread speculation and frustration among the early adopters who were eager to explore Perplexity AI's capabilities on their Samsung devices.</p><h3>Perplexity CEO Acknowledges Issue</h3><p>In response to the growing number of reports, Perplexity CEO Aravind Srinivas acknowledged the issue indirectly, without offering specific reasons for Samsung's decision or details on a potential return of the feature. This leaves a significant question mark over Samsung's strategy regarding third-party AI integrations and the longevity of such partnerships.</p><p>The rapid removal of 'Hey Plex' raises questions about the stability and long-term vision for AI features on flagship smartphones. While the reasons behind Samsung's decision remain unclear, the incident highlights the dynamic and sometimes volatile nature of AI integration in consumer technology, underscoring the challenges of bringing cutting-edge AI experiences consistently to users.</p>	Samsung's much-anticipated 'Hey Plex' AI assistant, powered by Perplexity AI, has reportedly vanished from Galaxy S26 devices following the first software update, leaving users puzzled.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1696041756125-257354c459a9?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxhcnRpZmljaWFsLWludGVsbGlnZW5jZSUyQyUyMHNhbXN1bmctZ2FsYXh5JTJDJTIwQUktYXNzaXN0YW50fGVufDB8MHx8fDE3NzMzMjQ3MDl8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	SamMobile	https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNbkJZSUNheHZjSDlmZXNEVG90ZkhPZUtPcjRKQ0VkWDJOODBpWUhVVVZ2WXFHWjVrcklXVmFIeTF5QUlmNVNkRzlFM2dIWm1TaHVCaFNNY0Z3SGl2Wjc2ZXFoVlNNMWFwQ05tdG1XUUV2RElXbmVHRzlGRC02aThwR0ZWYzY0S1hnY1dVUDd4Uk8?oc=5	\N	2026-03-12 14:11:49.975	2026-03-12 14:11:50.012074	AI	42
823	Prediction Market Crackdown: New Bill Seeks to Ban Sports Bets	Prediction Market Crackdown: New Bill Seeks to Ban Sports Bets	prediction-market-crackdown-new-bill-seeks-to-ban-sports-bets	<h3>Legislative Push Targets Emerging Betting Landscape</h3><p>A new legislative initiative is gaining traction, with a recently introduced bill specifically targeting the increasingly popular prediction market platforms. The proposed legislation seeks to outlaw sports bets made through these markets, signaling a significant move to clarify and potentially restrict the evolving landscape of online wagering.</p><p>Prediction markets, such as Kalshi and Polymarket, allow users to trade contracts based on the outcome of future events, ranging from politics and economic indicators to sports results. While proponents argue these platforms operate as financial exchanges offering unique hedging and informational tools, critics and now lawmakers contend that when applied to sports, they function indistinguishably from traditional sports betting, often operating outside the stringent regulatory frameworks governing licensed sportsbooks.</p><h3>Defining the Line Between Finance and Gambling</h3><p>The core of the debate revolves around the classification of these platforms. Current U.S. laws distinguish between regulated financial instruments and gambling. The new bill aims to draw a clearer line, asserting that wagering on sports outcomes, regardless of the underlying platform's design, should fall under sports betting regulations. If passed, this could have profound implications for companies that currently host sports-related contracts, forcing them to either cease offering such options or pursue traditional sports betting licenses.</p><p>Industry observers suggest this move reflects growing concern among regulators regarding the expansion of unregulated betting avenues. Lawmakers appear keen to ensure that all forms of sports wagering are subject to consumer protections, integrity measures, and tax revenues consistent with those applied to state-sanctioned sports betting operations.</p><h3>What's Next for Prediction Markets?</h3><p>The introduction of this bill sets the stage for a contentious debate in legislative chambers. Prediction market companies and their advocates are likely to push back, highlighting their platforms' unique features and perceived benefits. However, the legislative momentum indicates a serious intent to bring these activities under existing regulatory umbrellas, potentially transforming how Americans can bet on sports and engage with event-based financial contracts. The outcome of this bill will undoubtedly be closely watched by the financial technology sector, the sports betting industry, and consumers alike.</p>	A proposed bill aims to prohibit sports betting on popular prediction market platforms, potentially reshaping the landscape for online wagers and regulatory oversight.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586448910234-297fae7189e6?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxzcG9ydHMtYmV0dGluZyUyQyUyMG1hcmtldC1yZWd1bGF0aW9uJTJDJTIwcHJlZGljdGlvbi1tYXJrZXRzfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3NzQzNTUxMDJ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	ESPN	https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNRE5HNFZTRkUxRkpOdFNuZEdnSjVXUnZfODA0bk92UjlfRXpoRVBka1ZrUTBuVTdCdDdNUU16NFR3amVQN1h4aVBib3pqS0RFd2R2M2NjRjEzLVgzYXdpUFU4Qlh4ZHVweG93M2JtaDIwYl81M2lPb2JrRVpuZ2NQa3NhYVBjLVJLZGxwRmU2Wm0wNFppMkxycDZjQ2VfOHNVQ0kzZi0wYjVYMHBCRXEwZnNB?oc=5	\N	2026-03-24 12:25:02.281	2026-03-24 12:25:02.350007	Finance	6
49	Adobe Photoshop Unleashes Powerful AI Assistant and Firefly Integration	Adobe Photoshop Unleashes Powerful AI Assistant and Firefly Integration	adobe-photoshop-unleashes-powerful-ai-assistant-and-firefly-integration	<h3>Photoshop Gets Smarter: A New Era of AI-Powered Image Editing</h3><p>Adobe has unveiled a groundbreaking suite of artificial intelligence tools integrated into Photoshop, fundamentally transforming how photographers and designers interact with their images. The latest update introduces an intelligent AI assistant and deeper integration with Adobe's Firefly generative AI, allowing users to achieve complex edits with unprecedented ease through simple text prompts.</p><p>This innovative leap empowers users to converse directly with Photoshop, telling it precisely how to modify or enhance their photos. From subtle adjustments to dramatic transformations, the AI assistant interprets natural language commands, streamlining workflows and opening new creative avenues for both seasoned professionals and novice editors.</p><h3>Intuitive Control with Generative AI</h3><p>At the heart of this update is the robust integration of Adobe Firefly, which powers several new generative features within Photoshop. Users can now leverage capabilities such as Generative Fill and Generative Expand to non-destructively add, remove, or extend content in their images by simply describing what they want. For instance, a user could prompt, “add a vintage sepia filter,” “remove the background noise,” or “expand the canvas and fill with a cloudy sky,” and the AI would execute the command with remarkable precision.</p><p>This means photographers are no longer limited by their technical expertise in complex masking, cloning, or retouching. Instead, they can articulate their creative vision, and Photoshop's AI will generate the desired outcome, significantly reducing the time spent on repetitive tasks and fostering a more experimental approach to editing.</p><h3>The Future of Creative Workflows</h3><p>The introduction of these AI tools marks a significant milestone in Adobe's commitment to augmenting human creativity with intelligent technology. The AI assistant acts as a co-pilot, guiding users through the editing process and offering suggestions, while Firefly's generative capabilities provide a powerful engine for imaginative content creation. This synergy promises to accelerate productivity, democratize advanced editing techniques, and enable creators to focus more on artistic expression rather than technical execution.</p><p>As these AI capabilities continue to evolve, the line between human instruction and machine execution blurs, paving the way for a future where image editing is not just a skill but a seamless, conversational process. Adobe's latest Photoshop update is a clear indicator that the future of creative software is intelligent, intuitive, and immensely powerful.</p>	Adobe's Photoshop now features a powerful AI assistant and Firefly integration, enabling users to edit images with simple text prompts, revolutionizing creative workflows and boosting efficiency.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633311905139-7b6088a69e33?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxhcnRpZmljaWFsLWludGVsbGlnZW5jZSUyQyUyMHBob3RvLWVkaXRpbmclMkMlMjBjcmVhdGl2ZS1zb2Z0d2FyZXxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzczMzI0OTg4fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	Adobe, PetaPixel, eWeek, TechCrunch, The Verge	https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNTXpJYkoxVGRJRmVIcmF1MWVWdGxkVFVuZDJfMFFmZDllWEtzR3dwU3dtRjRnTzcybVpVNlVxOFV1QVNhd2VITm5aQnNOWEg2ZWhrLUcyMWc1ODdCS1FXNFVhWkFLQ05ZME1KQjVXdWU1VzR5clNPa3N2VGhBYjdaLVRaRVFQbmc0QzllTXRoaGozWlBaa0l4dXhKbjc3aHpMQnZR?oc=5	\N	2026-03-12 14:16:28.494	2026-03-12 14:16:28.535221	AI	37
537	Everyday Charms: 'Local Times' Series Shines with Relatable Workplace Comedy	Everyday Charms: 'Local Times' Series Shines with Relatable Workplace Comedy	everyday-charms-local-times-series-shines-with-relatable-workplace-comedy	<h3>'Local Times' Finds Joy in the Mundane, Earns Praise for Refreshing Authenticity</h3><p>In an era often dominated by high-stakes drama and complex narratives, the new series 'Local Times' is carving out its own niche by embracing the simple, often overlooked joys of everyday office life. Reviewed by The Hollywood Reporter India, the workplace comedy is celebrated for delivering a brand of humor that is both accessible and profoundly relatable, offering what the publication aptly describes as 'basic pleasures.'</p><p>The series appears to sidestep the frantic pace and exaggerated scenarios typical of many modern comedies, instead focusing on the more subtle, genuine interactions and predicaments that unfold within a typical professional setting. This deliberate choice allows 'Local Times' to cultivate an authentic atmosphere, drawing viewers into its world with characters and situations that feel remarkably familiar.</p><p>Critics highlight the show's ability to extract humor from the minutiae of office routines – the awkward encounters by the water cooler, the peculiar habits of colleagues, or the low-stakes triumphs and frustrations of daily tasks. It's a comedy that doesn't rely on grand gestures or shock value, but rather on the understated charm of its ensemble cast and well-observed scripting.</p><p>For audiences seeking a respite from the often-overwhelming complexity of contemporary storytelling, 'Local Times' presents a refreshing alternative. Its gentle humor and heartwarming approach to the workplace offer a comforting escape, reminding us that sometimes, the most profound entertainment can be found in the familiar and the unassuming. The series is a testament to the idea that compelling narratives don't always need to reinvent the wheel; sometimes, a well-executed exploration of shared human experiences is more than enough to captivate and delight.</p>	The Hollywood Reporter India praises 'Local Times' for its unassuming appeal and gentle humor. This new workplace comedy series offers delightful basic pleasures, resonating with everyday office experiences.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758691737182-d42aefd6dee8?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHx3b3JrcGxhY2UtY29tZWR5JTJDJTIwdHYtc2VyaWVzJTJDJTIwb2ZmaWNlLWxpZmV8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc3Mzc0OTk2Nnww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	The Hollywood Reporter India	https://news.google.?oc=5	\N	2026-03-17 12:19:26.181	2026-03-17 12:19:26.22555	Entertainment	11
935	Lawmakers Push to Suspend Federal Gas Tax Amid Soaring Fuel Prices	Lawmakers Push to Suspend Federal Gas Tax Amid Soaring Fuel Prices	lawmakers-push-to-suspend-federal-gas-tax-amid-soaring-fuel-prices	<p>WASHINGTON D.C. – With the specter of a potential conflict involving Iran driving a sharp increase in global oil prices, American consumers are feeling the pinch at the pump. In response, a bipartisan group of lawmakers is now championing a controversial proposal: a temporary suspension of the federal gas tax.</p>\n\n<h3>The Proposal: A Tax Holiday for Drivers</h3>\n<p>The federal gas tax, currently 18.4 cents per gallon for gasoline and 24.4 cents per gallon for diesel, is a crucial funding mechanism for the nation's infrastructure, specifically its highways and mass transit systems. Proponents of the suspension argue that a pause, even temporary, would offer immediate financial relief to households and businesses grappling with escalating transportation costs.</p>\n\n<p>“Families are already stretching their budgets, and the added burden of skyrocketing fuel prices is unacceptable,” stated one congressional aide. “Suspending this tax, even for a short period, could provide much-needed breathing room.”</p>\n\n<h3>Funding Dilemma: Highway Trust Fund at Risk</h3>\n<p>However, the proposal faces significant opposition, primarily due to concerns about the long-term health of the Highway Trust Fund. This fund, which relies almost entirely on fuel taxes, is already facing solvency issues. A suspension, critics argue, would exacerbate these problems, potentially delaying vital infrastructure projects and putting construction jobs at risk.</p>\n\n<p>Opponents suggest that alternative revenue sources would need to be identified to backfill the deficit caused by a gas tax holiday. Without a clear plan, the nation's aging infrastructure could suffer further neglect.</p>\n\n<h3>Geopolitical Undercurrents Drive Price Hikes</h3>\n<p>The renewed push for a gas tax suspension comes as crude oil prices surge on international markets, largely attributed to heightened tensions and the perceived risk of supply disruptions in the Middle East following recent escalations involving Iran. Analysts predict that if the geopolitical situation deteriorates further, fuel prices could continue their upward trajectory, intensifying pressure on policymakers to act.</p>\n\n<p>As the debate unfolds in Congress, the focus remains on balancing immediate consumer relief with the critical need for sustainable infrastructure funding, all while navigating an volatile global energy landscape. The outcome of this legislative push could have significant implications for both American pocketbooks and the nation's roads.</p>	As geopolitical tensions drive fuel prices skyward, U.S. lawmakers are advocating for a temporary suspension of the federal gas tax to ease consumer burden and highway funding concerns.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585538615744-3f6fecad04ac?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxnYXMtcHVtcCUyQyUyMGZ1ZWwtcHJpY2VzJTJDJTIwZWNvbm9teXxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzc0NzE3Mjk1fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	Fortune	https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPV3NIOHJMMVNqNkE5eTR1RzRYUnltaHdndVBISEQ2ZWVyMENhS1E2NnNVRUhZV0VrTUdJazR1ekdlZENrMlZoVEpnb0JEZ2dDbk43dl9wTFVPTzBLUWVQS0txenczeUNHdzA0QTdhaktsc1B5T2lZRVJabHJuUEdjRWJWaHI5M1V4ZV9kdW9ZXzhKdwVWOGFGdjhzZUJHVU5ZVHluOHhub0x3dEhR?oc=5	\N	2026-03-28 17:01:35.861	2026-03-28 17:01:35.935121	Finance	2
621	Millions Prepare for Week of Record-Shattering Temperatures	Millions Prepare for Week of Record-Shattering Temperatures	millions-prepare-for-week-of-record-shattering-temperatures	<p>A significant portion of the population is preparing for an unprecedented week of extreme heat, as meteorological forecasts predict record-shattering temperatures that will dominate across various regions. The impending heatwave is expected to affect millions, prompting public health warnings and raising concerns for infrastructure and daily life.</p>\n<h3>Widespread Impact Expected</h3>\n<p>Forecasters from The Weather Channel indicate that the conditions are ripe for temperatures to soar to historic highs, pushing past previous records for this time of year. This extended period of intense heat poses considerable risks, particularly for vulnerable populations, including the elderly, young children, and individuals with pre-existing health conditions.</p>\n<p>Authorities are urging residents to take proactive measures to mitigate the dangers associated with extreme heat. Recommendations include staying hydrated by drinking plenty of water, seeking air-conditioned environments, limiting strenuous outdoor activities, and checking on neighbors and family members who may be at risk. Local emergency services are on heightened alert, ready to respond to heat-related incidents.</p>\n<h3>Preparing for the Sweltering Conditions</h3>\n<p>The prolonged nature of this heatwave means that communities and utility providers are also preparing for potential strain on power grids as demand for air conditioning surges. Experts are closely monitoring the situation, advising energy conservation where possible to prevent outages.</p>\n<p>As the week progresses, meteorologists will continue to provide updates, emphasizing the importance of staying informed and adhering to official guidance to navigate these exceptionally hot conditions safely.</p>	Millions across several regions are bracing for a week o