ict makes precise preparations difficult.</p>\n\n<p>For Iran's neighbors, the immediate concern is not only the direct impact of potential hostilities but also the secondary effects, particularly the humanitarian fallout. Ensuring the safety and well-being of displaced populations will require a coordinated international response and significant resources, far beyond what any single nation can provide.</p>\n\n<p>The situation serves as a stark reminder of the delicate balance in the Middle East and the urgent need for a peaceful resolution to ongoing disputes to avert further human suffering.</p>	Regional nations are bracing for a potential refugee influx as escalating tensions surrounding Iran threaten widespread conflict, raising humanitarian concerns across the Middle East.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1728322150375-d6a2accce6d9?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxyZWZ1Z2VlJTIwY3Jpc2lzJTJDJTIwbWlkZGxlJTIwZWFzdCUyMGNvbmZsaWN0JTJDJTIwaHVtYW5pdGFyaWFuJTIwYWlkfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3NzM3MzM3MDZ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	Al Jazeera	https://news.google.?oc=5	\N	2026-03-17 07:48:26.61	2026-03-17 07:48:26.649324	World	9
