 the mutual respect and professional chemistry they share, which undoubtedly contributes to the magic they create on screen.</p><p>As details surrounding 'Bhooth Bangla' continue to emerge, the excitement builds for what promises to be a unique cinematic experience rooted in the supernatural narratives that have captivated humanity for ages.</p><p>#BhoothBangla #Priyadarshan #AkshayKumar #Bollywood</p>	Filmmaker Priyadarshan discusses his upcoming project 'Bhooth Bangla,' a film inspired by age-old folk stories, and highlights Akshay Kumar's consistent lucky presence in his career.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1764581659101-0c2a38ebe301?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxmaWxtLWRpcmVjdG9yJTJDJTIwYm9sbHl3b29kLWFjdG9yJTJDJTIwbW92aWUtc2V0fGVufDB8MHx8fDE3NzM3NTA5OTl8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	Bollywood Hungama	https://news.google.?oc=5	\N	2026-03-17 12:36:39.224	2026-03-17 12:36:39.265699	Entertainment	22
