722	Minnesota basks in Record-Breaking Saturday Warmth	Minnesota basks in Record-Breaking Saturday Warmth	minnesota-basks-in-record-breaking-saturday-warmth	<p>MINNEAPOLIS-ST. PAUL — Residents across Minnesota experienced an unexpected treat this past Saturday as the state recorded unprecedented warm temperatures, shattering historical benchmarks for the date.</p><p>The unseasonably mild weather transformed a typical late-winter day into a preview of spring, inviting Minnesotans outdoors to enjoy activities usually reserved for much later in the year. Thermometers across the region climbed well above average, eclipsing previous records that had stood for decades.</p><p><strong>Early Spring Delight</strong></p><p>The surge in temperatures brought a palpable sense of relief and joy, as many took advantage of the balmy conditions for walks, park visits, and other outdoor pursuits. While a brief respite, the warmth provided a refreshing break from the usual chill of the season, prompting discussions about the changing climate patterns.</p><p>Local meteorologists confirmed the record-breaking nature of the warmth, noting that such an early and significant deviation from seasonal norms is a notable event. The pleasant conditions, however, are often a temporary phenomenon, with more characteristic winter or early spring weather expected to return.</p>	Minnesota saw record-breaking warmth this past Saturday, with temperatures soaring to unseasonable highs. Residents enjoyed an early taste of spring as historical records were shattered.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1746917317603-bf7b91e6965b?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxNaW5uZXNvdGElMjBsYW5kc2NhcGUlMkMlMjB3YXJtJTIwd2VhdGhlciUyQyUyMHNwcmluZyUyMHN1bnNoaW5lfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3NzQxOTAxMjd8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	FOX 9 Minneapolis-St. Paul	https://news.google.?oc=1	\N	2026-03-22 14:35:27.129	2026-03-22 14:35:27.206266	World	13
