 investment in education, skill development, and a flexible approach to career paths.</p><p>#AIImpact #FutureOfWork #TechInnovation #PerplexityAI</p>	Perplexity CEO Aravind Srinivas anticipates temporary job displacement due to AI, but highlights the significant long-term potential for new roles and economic growth.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1737644467636-6b0053476bb2?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTMxMTJ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxhcnRpZmljaWFsLWludGVsbGlnZW5jZSUyQyUyMGpvYi1tYXJrZXQlMkMlMjBmdXR1cmUtd29ya3xlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzc0MzU0NTQzfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080	Business Insider	https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOeHJXRnFLMkt2X21WX2loT1VkMGRUUEdsampGUl9tOEF4TGRGcWM5X3Ntb1lrOEN5bGhrWjJteFNFc0JoRzU1N3ZnY3JPU2oxcWtaNm1FcU1DSWhVU0NpRGp6aDY1aFRsNGx1WkwteFVhb1VfU3YzaldJbDZLazlRcERZOTV6MUZxN1dkSkFXT1V2MFcwaFQyZXdPUzUtbS16SzFQLQ?oc=5	\N	2026-03-24 12:15:43.444	2026-03-24 12:15:43.526216	AI	6
